{
  "id": "example.mountain-camp",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "exports": [
    "visit"
  ],
  "content": {
    "fire": {
      "title": "篝火夜谈",
      "paragraphs": [
        "{{parameter.visitor}}在火边坐下。守火老人用树枝拨了拨炭，把空出来的地方让给你。",
        "这次停留，老人已招呼过你 {{local.greetings}} 次。袋中还剩 {{shared.rations}} 份干粮；此前你在这里歇过 {{shared.rests}} 次脚。"
      ]
    },
    "letter": {
      "title": "老者的信",
      "paragraphs": [
        "老人从衣襟里取出信，抚平封口上的折痕。信封上没有名字，只画着山口石门的轮廓。",
        "“交到守门人的手里就好。”他说完，便把目光移回火上。"
      ]
    },
    "rest": {
      "title": "整理行囊",
      "paragraphs": [
        "你吃了一份干粮，等湿透的衣袖慢慢烤干。老人替你收紧背带，提醒你沿途当心落石。",
        "天边还留着一点亮色。现在可以重新上路了。"
      ]
    }
  },
  "graphs": {
    "visit": {
      "title": "营地互动",
      "parameters": {
        "visitor": "text"
      },
      "locals": {
        "greetings": 0
      },
      "shared": {
        "rations": "int",
        "letter": "bool",
        "rests": "int"
      },
      "entry": "greet",
      "outcomes": [
        "left",
        "rested"
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "greet": {
          "type_id": "narrata.mutate",
          "data": {
            "assignments": [
              {
                "target": {
                  "scope": "local",
                  "name": "greetings"
                },
                "value": {
                  "kind": "binary",
                  "op": "add",
                  "left": {
                    "kind": "read",
                    "scope": "local",
                    "name": "greetings"
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "kind": "literal",
                    "value": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "next": "fire"
          }
        },
        "fire": {
          "type_id": "narrata.decision",
          "data": {
            "content": "fire",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "letter",
                "label": "询问老人留下的信",
                "visible_if": {
                  "kind": "not",
                  "value": {
                    "kind": "read",
                    "scope": "shared",
                    "name": "letter"
                  }
                },
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "target": {
                      "scope": "shared",
                      "name": "letter"
                    },
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "literal",
                      "value": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "target": "letter"
              },
              {
                "id": "rest",
                "label": "吃一份干粮，在火边歇脚",
                "enabled_if": {
                  "kind": "binary",
                  "op": "gt",
                  "left": {
                    "kind": "read",
                    "scope": "shared",
                    "name": "rations"
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "kind": "literal",
                    "value": 0
                  }
                },
                "disabled_reason": "干粮已经用完",
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "target": {
                      "scope": "shared",
                      "name": "rations"
                    },
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "binary",
                      "op": "sub",
                      "left": {
                        "kind": "read",
                        "scope": "shared",
                        "name": "rations"
                      },
                      "right": {
                        "kind": "literal",
                        "value": 1
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "target": {
                      "scope": "shared",
                      "name": "rests"
                    },
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "binary",
                      "op": "add",
                      "left": {
                        "kind": "read",
                        "scope": "shared",
                        "name": "rests"
                      },
                      "right": {
                        "kind": "literal",
                        "value": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "target": "rest"
              },
              {
                "id": "leave",
                "label": "收拾行囊，回到驿站",
                "target": "left"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "letter": {
          "type_id": "narrata.content",
          "data": {
            "content": "letter",
            "label": "收好信，回到篝火旁",
            "next": "fire"
          }
        },
        "rest": {
          "type_id": "narrata.content",
          "data": {
            "content": "rest",
            "label": "向老人告别",
            "next": "rested"
          }
        },
        "left": {
          "type_id": "narrata.return",
          "data": {
            "outcome": "left"
          }
        },
        "rested": {
          "type_id": "narrata.return",
          "data": {
            "outcome": "rested"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
